==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|ka}}

===Pronoun===
'''kaikki''' (''singular/plural'')
# (''indefinite; in singular, without a main word'') [[everything]].
#:*[[tänään|Tänään]] '''kaikki''' [[mennä|menee]] [[pieli|pieleen]].
#:**Today ''everything'' goes wrong.
# ''indefinite; in plural, without a main word'') [[everyone]], [[everybody]].
#:*'''Kaikki''' [[olla|olivat]] [[täällä]].
#:**''Everyone'' was here.
# (''indefinite; in singular and plural, as a modifier'') [[all]].
#:*'''Kaikki''' [[sukka]][[-ni|ni]] [[löytyä|löytyivät]].
#:**''All'' my socks were found.
#:*[[yhtäkkiä|Yhtäkkiä]] '''kaikki''' [[vesi]] [[vyöryä|vyöryi]] [[huoneisto]]on.
#:**Suddenly ''all'' the water ran into the apartment.
# As a former part of compound (in nominative or genitive) signifies [[all-]], [[omni-]].

